# Only the serverless function belongs on Vercel.
#
# This repo is GHL page source: the HTML in pages/ and global-sections/
# is meant to be pasted into Custom Code elements, and preview/ is a
# local dev convenience carrying dev-only shims. Without this file a
# deploy would publish all of it at a public vercel.app URL, including
# placeholder content and the preview navigation rewrites.
#
# Everything except api/ is excluded, so the deployment is the proxy
# and nothing else.

pages/
global-sections/
preview/
*.md
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
